{
 "description": "Gaze-head redirection on Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct, scored without a judge: each panel of a lettered strip carries a random letter, the prompt asks for the letter on this panel (`ambiguous`) or on the k-th panel (`chat`), and the top-100 gaze heads (from gaze_discovery) have their attention scores biased by +10000 on the target panel's image tokens and -10000 on the other panels', in the prefill, which is where a one-letter answer is chosen. `hit` is 1 where the most likely next token is the target panel's letter; `clean_hit` where it is the queried panel's. `control` biases 100 random heads from layers 20-35 outside the gaze set, `null` biases the gaze heads by 0.",
 "model": {
  "key": "Qwen/Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct",
